---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Careers — Sorted';
const description = "A small Brisbane team rebuilding Australian peer-to-peer payments. Not actively hiring, always reading open applications.";
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
<section class="subhero dotgrid">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Sorted</a><span class="sep"></span><span>Company</span><span class="sep"></span><span>Careers</span></div>
    <span class="subhero-eyebrow">Company · Careers</span>
    <h1>Build money the way it <span class="hl">should've worked.</span></h1>
    <p class="subhero-sub">Small Brisbane team. Big ambition. <strong>We're not running open roles right now,</strong> but we read every open application and keep the good ones close.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section reveal"><div class="container">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What the work is.</h2>
      <p>Most fintech work is incremental. Sorted is the rare chance to rebuild Australian peer-to-peer payments from the rails up: a regulated product, real-time settlement, and a mobile experience your mum can use without asking what a wallet is. The team is small enough that what you ship gets used by real people the same week.</p>
      <h2>Who we'd love to hear from.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Product engineers</strong> comfortable across a TypeScript stack, who care how things feel.</li>
        <li><strong>Backend engineers</strong> who've handled money, ledgers or Solana before, or want to learn properly.</li>
        <li><strong>Designers</strong> with a mobile-first portfolio and opinions about calm interfaces.</li>
        <li><strong>Risk and compliance people</strong> who know AFSL and AUSTRAC obligations from the inside.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>How to apply.</h2>
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@paymentsorted.com?subject=Open%20application">hello@paymentsorted.com</a> with "Open application" in the subject and one page about something you shipped that you're proud of. Links beat résumés.</p>
    </div></div></section>
<section class="page-cta">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="page-cta-inner reveal">
      <h2 class="page-cta-title">Tell us what you've built.</h2>
      <p class="page-cta-sub">One page. Something you shipped. We'll write back.</p>
      <div class="page-cta-actions">
        <a href="mailto:hello@paymentsorted.com?subject=Open%20application" class="btn btn-dark btn-lg">Open application <svg class="icon"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"/></svg></a>
        <a href="/why-sorted" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Why Sorted</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Base>
